cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use UFM in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "UFM — Unified Fractal Memory"
abstract: >-
  A residency manager that treats GPU VRAM and CPU RAM as one elastic pool,
  prefetching and evicting model sub-modules (e.g. MoE experts) so a single GPU
  can run models whose footprint exceeds device memory. Extracted from the
  Fractal Neurons research program.
type: software
